Speech for Folio: putting it in
================================

Drag the !Folio in this archive over your own !Folio (onto the directory
that holds it): the Filer adds Plugins.Speech to it and leaves the rest of
your !Folio as it is. Then quit Folio and run it again. A speaker button
appears at the right of the toolbar.

To take speech out again, delete !Folio.Plugins.Speech (Shift-double-click
!Folio to open it).

!Folio.Plugins.Speech.ReadMe says what speech needs and how to use it.
